{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "retainpdf/contracts/job-actions/v1",
  "title": "任务操作契约（Job Actions）",
  "description": "任务操作 /api/v1/jobs/:job_id/actions/…：现在能做哪些操作、续跑计划、取消、续跑、重试某个阶段、OCR 派发拿不准时由用户选。生产者：backend/packages/retainpdf-jobs/src/views/job_types.rs（StageActionsView、JobResumePlanView、RetryStageRequest、RetryStageSubmissionView、OcrAmbiguityResolution*、ActionBlockReason）、views/common.rs（JobSubmissionView）、backend/api/src/routes/jobs/actions.rs（续跑请求体 RerunRequest）；消费者：@retainpdf/contracts/job-actions 生成 DTO（前端以后用它换掉 frontend/packages/api/src/jobs-actions.ts 里手写的类型）。所有响应为 {code, message, data} 信封，本契约描述 data 部分；操作被拒的 409 在 error.details.reason 里给 ActionBlockReason 的值。键的写法照 Rust 实际序列化：类型是 [\"x\", \"null\"] 的键总在、空时是 null；没写进 required 的返回键是空时整个省掉（不是 null）。请求体 additionalProperties: false 对应 Rust 的 deny_unknown_fields。JobStatusKind、WorkflowKind、JobStagesView、JobStageRuntimeView、JobStageStateView、JobProgressView、JobLinksView、JobActionsView、ActionLinkView、JsonValue 是 job-status.v1 的副本，OcrAmbiguityResolutionKind 和 job-reports.v1 共用（契约只许本文件内 $ref），contracts/tests/job-shared-definitions-parity.test.mjs 守着结构一致。Rust 侧由 backend/api/src/api_tests/job_actions_reports_contract.rs 对真实接口的返回钉键集合，并把请求类型的字段集合和这里对上。改契约先改本文件，再重新生成 DTO 并让两端测试变绿。",
  "base_path": "/api/v1",
  "endpoints": [
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/jobs/:job_id/actions",
      "client_name": "listJobActions",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "StageActionsView",
      "rust_view": "StageActionsView",
      "ts_consumer": "@retainpdf/contracts/job-actions :: StageActionsView",
      "note": "每个阶段（ocr、translation、render、refine）现在能不能重试、为什么不能、重试的请求怎么写（action.body 就是一份能直接发给 retry-stage 的 RetryStageRequest）。任务不存在 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/jobs/:job_id/actions/cancel",
      "client_name": "cancelJob",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "JobSubmissionView",
      "rust_view": "JobSubmissionView",
      "ts_consumer": "@retainpdf/contracts/job-actions :: JobSubmissionView",
      "note": "不读请求体（发 {} 或不发都行）。返回库里的真实状态，不一定是 canceled：任务在取消前一刻自己跑完了是 succeeded；OCR 任务过了排队阶段时只杀进程，终态稍后由 runner 落，此刻还是 running。任务不在排队 / 运行中 409，error.details.reason=job_not_active；任务不存在 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/jobs/:job_id/actions/resolve-ocr-ambiguity",
      "client_name": "resolveOcrAmbiguity",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "OcrAmbiguityResolutionRequest",
      "output": "OcrAmbiguityResolutionView",
      "rust_view": "OcrAmbiguityResolutionView",
      "ts_consumer": "@retainpdf/contracts/job-actions :: OcrAmbiguityResolutionView",
      "note": "OCR 派发结果拿不准时（失败诊断 reports/failure 的 ocr_ambiguity 不为 null）由用户选：绑定已有回执，或接受重复派发。成功后建一个恢复任务（submission.job_id）。409 的 error.details.reason：job_active（任务在跑）、no_ocr_dispatch（没有可处理的歧义：任务不是失败 / 已取消，或没有记录在案的派发）、stale_resolution（resolution_revision 过期，或已被别的请求处理，刷新失败诊断再试）、ocr_dispatch_unsupported（这个服务商 / 操作不支持绑定回执）。回执字段不对 400：bind_existing_receipt 缺必填字段（看 ocr_ambiguity.receipt_fields 的 required）、填了不属于这个服务商 / 操作的字段；accept_duplicate_risk 填了任何回执字段。accept_duplicate_risk 走的是 retry-stage stage=ocr，那边的 409 原因也可能出现。多用户模式下页数额度不够 402，error.code=PAGE_QUOTA_EXCEEDED。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/jobs/:job_id/actions/resume",
      "client_name": "getResumePlan",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "JobResumePlanView",
      "rust_view": "JobResumePlanView",
      "ts_consumer": "@retainpdf/contracts/job-actions :: JobResumePlanView",
      "note": "续跑会从哪个阶段开始、复用哪些产物、重跑哪些阶段；不能续跑时 can_resume=false，reason_code 给机器可读原因。任务不存在 404；旧目录格式的任务 409。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/jobs/:job_id/actions/resume",
      "client_name": "resumeJob",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "ResumeJobInput",
      "output": "JobSubmissionView",
      "rust_view": "JobSubmissionView",
      "ts_consumer": "@retainpdf/contracts/job-actions :: JobSubmissionView",
      "note": "从断点续跑（旧地址 actions/rerun 已登记为旧名，同一个实现）。请求体可以不带或发 {}；只接受换模型 key（见 ResumeJobInput），其它设置一律沿用原任务。能原地重渲染时 job_id 就是原任务，否则是新任务。409 的 error.details.reason：job_active（先取消）、artifacts_missing（没有可复用的断点）、model_executor_unsupported、ambiguous_ocr_dispatch（先用 resolve-ocr-ambiguity）、request_journal_corrupt、ambiguous_translation_request（改用 retry-stage stage=translation + ambiguous_request_policy=accept_duplicate_risk）、stale_resolution（原地重跑时任务在读取后变了，刷新再试）。overrides 写错 400。多用户模式下页数额度不够 402，error.code=PAGE_QUOTA_EXCEEDED。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/jobs/:job_id/actions/retry-stage",
      "client_name": "retryJobStage",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "RetryStageRequest",
      "output": "RetryStageSubmissionView",
      "rust_view": "RetryStageSubmissionView",
      "ts_consumer": "@retainpdf/contracts/job-actions :: RetryStageSubmissionView",
      "note": "重试某一个阶段。ocr / translation 一律新建任务；render 默认新建任务，create_new_job=false 时原地重渲染；refine 只支持原地（create_new_job 省略即 false）。请求写错 400：不认识的字段、mode 不是 from_stage、refine 带在别的 stage 上、ocr / translation 给了 create_new_job=false、refine 给了 create_new_job=true、overrides 段名或字段不对。409 的 error.details.reason：job_active、model_executor_unsupported、ambiguous_ocr_dispatch（stage=ocr 且没接受重复风险）、artifacts_missing、translations_not_owned（精修要写回的译文不是这个任务自己的）、request_journal_corrupt、ambiguous_translation_request（stage=translation 且没接受重复风险）、stale_resolution（原地执行时任务在读取后变了）。多用户模式下页数额度不够 402，error.code=PAGE_QUOTA_EXCEEDED。"
    }
  ],
  "definitions": {
    "ActionBlockReason": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "job_active",
        "job_not_active",
        "artifacts_missing",
        "translations_not_owned",
        "ambiguous_translation_request",
        "ambiguous_ocr_dispatch",
        "request_journal_corrupt",
        "model_executor_unsupported",
        "stale_resolution",
        "no_ocr_dispatch",
        "ocr_dispatch_unsupported"
      ],
      "description": "job_types.rs :: ActionBlockReason。「任务 / 产物的当前状态不允许这个操作」的稳定机器可读原因：操作被拒时放进 409 的 error.details.reason；GET 里是阶段操作的 disabled_code、续跑计划的 reason_code。值只增不改，客户端按它分支，不要解析文字说明。"
    },
    "ActionLinkView": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "enabled",
        "method",
        "path",
        "url"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "enabled": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "method": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "url": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "AmbiguousRequestPolicy": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "block",
        "accept_duplicate_risk"
      ],
      "description": "job_types.rs :: AmbiguousRequestPolicy。上游请求结果拿不准时怎么办：block（默认，停下等人确认）、accept_duplicate_risk（接受可能重复请求 / 重复扣费，接着跑）。"
    },
    "EscalatedItemView": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "job_types.rs :: EscalatedItemView。编辑部留给人确认的一块。",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "item_id",
        "page_number",
        "reason"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "item_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "page_number": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "JobActionsView": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "open_job",
        "open_artifacts",
        "cancel",
        "resume",
        "rerun",
        "download_pdf",
        "open_markdown",
        "open_markdown_raw",
        "download_bundle"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "open_job": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ActionLinkView"
        },
        "open_artifacts": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ActionLinkView"
        },
        "cancel": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ActionLinkView"
        },
        "resume": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ActionLinkView"
        },
        "rerun": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ActionLinkView"
        },
        "download_pdf": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ActionLinkView"
        },
        "open_markdown": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ActionLinkView"
        },
        "open_markdown_raw": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ActionLinkView"
        },
        "download_bundle": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/ActionLinkView"
        }
      },
      "description": "job-status.v1 JobActionsView 的副本。resume：从断点续跑 POST actions/resume；rerun：旧名，和 resume 同值，地址是旧地址 actions/rerun，新代码读 resume。"
    },
    "JobLinksView": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "self_path",
        "self_url",
        "artifacts_path",
        "artifacts_url",
        "artifacts_manifest_path",
        "artifacts_manifest_url",
        "events_path",
        "events_url",
        "cancel_path",
        "cancel_url"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "self_path": {
          "type": "string"
